IONS ━━━<br><br>Explore White's active bishop-pair continuations after 10. Rb1: } { [%csl Yb1,Ge4] [%cal Bb1b7,Gf2f3,Gd4d5,Rc5d4] } ( 10. Rb1 b6 11. h3 cxd4 12. cxd4 { — 11. h3 keeps ...Bg4 off the board cleanly before recapturing 12. cxd4 with a broad center — +0.40.<br><br>And if Black liquidates immediately with 10... cxd4?: } ) ( 10. Rb1 cxd4 11. cxd4 exd4 12. Bg5 { — 12. Bg5! pins f6 immediately with ferocious piece play for the pawn — +0.44. } ) *

